  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The radius of your Awakened Season increases to 60 feet. Additionally, you have the following spell prepared based on your chosen season. You can cast this spell once without expending a spell slot. You cannot do so again until you have finished a Long Rest.</p><p><strong>Spring.</strong> Power Word Fortify.</p><p><strong>Summer.</strong> Sunburst.</p><p><strong>Autumn.</strong> Abi-Dalzim's Horrid Wilting.</p><p><strong>Winter.</strong> Polar Ray.</p>",
